            "type": "model",
            "used_in": "hazard",
            "description": "Probabilistic Windstorm Hazard Event Set for Europe produced by ETH Zurich, based on WISC (Windstorm Information Service for Europe) historic storm footprints extended probabilistically to generate a synthetic event catalogue. Provided as per-country HDF5 containers at approximately 4.4 km grid resolution. Each event includes a unique identifier, yearly frequency, origin flag (historic WISC event or probabilistically perturbed synthetic), and an intensity matrix of maximum wind gust speed in m/s per grid cell."
          }
