          "description": "HDF5 container with European windstorm hazard events on a ~4.4 km grid for country XXX (ISO3). Includes datasets: (1) event_id – unique event identifier; (2) frequency – yearly frequency per event; (3) orig – boolean (True = historic WISC event; False = probabilistically perturbed); (4) intensity – matrix of maximum wind gust speed per event (axis 0) and grid cell (axis 1), units m/s. Grid coordinates provided in centroids/lat and centroids/lon groups. Source: WISC historic footprints extended probabilistically; see README for methods and references.",
